course: dictionary
lesson: 9953
title: Tasty and looks tasty
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Tasty is an adjective, so it describes a noun. It means having a good, pleasant flavour, so the food tastes nice when you eat it. «Dad made a tasty sandwich for my lunch.» The sandwich is the tasty thing, and Dad made it for you to enjoy.
explain: Tasty can be compared: tastier and tastiest. «The cuttlefish waited for its favourite shrimp instead of eating a less tasty crab at once.» Less tasty means not as nice to eat, so the cuttlefish wanted the shrimp more.
explain: Be careful when food looks tasty. «Many berries that look tasty are poisonous.» Tasty here is about how the berries look, but the word poisonous warns you. Looks can be wrong, so never eat a berry only because it looks tasty.
fact: Tasty means having a good, pleasant flavour.
fact: Tasty, tastier and tastiest are used to compare how nice food is: «a tasty snack», «a tastier snack», «the tastiest snack».
fact: Tasty treat and tasty snack are common phrases for food people enjoy.
fact: Healthy food like fruit and vegetables can be tasty too.
fact: «Look tasty» means something seems as if it would taste nice, but looks can be wrong.
exercise: «Dad cooked a tasty pasta for dinner.» What does tasty mean here? | Too big to eat | Cooked in a pan for too long | Very hot to touch | *Having a good, pleasant flavour
exercise: «The baker's second loaf was tastier than the first.» Find and copy the word that compares two things. | *tastier | tasty | second | loaf
exercise: «Many berries that look tasty are poisonous.» What does look tasty suggest here? | *It seems as if it would taste nice, but it may be dangerous | It means the berries are cold | It is the safest way to choose a berry | It means the berries are ripe and sweet to eat
test: Which word is the form for the nicest flavour of all? | tastier | tasty | tasteful | *tastiest
test: Which of these is a healthy food that can also be tasty? | Fizzy sweets | Crisps | Sugary cola | *An apple
exam: Why should you not eat a berry just because it looks tasty? | Because all berries are tasty | *Because many berries that look tasty are poisonous | Because berries are always sour | Because tasty means it is cold
